The '''[[2026–27 in Scottish football|2026–27 season]]''' is [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]]'s 133rd season of competitive football.

==Pre-season and friendlies==
Celtic faced [[Shelbourne F.C.|Shelbourne]] in early July before travelling to Portugal for a training camp, where they played a friendly against [[Sporting CP]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/june/10/celtic-heading-to-dublin-for-pre-season-clash-with-shelbourne/ | title=Celtic heading to Dublin for pre-season clash with Shelbourne | publisher=Celtic FC | date=10 June 2026 | access-date=30 June 2026}}</ref> On returning to Glasgow, they faced [[Middlesbrough F.C.|Middlesbrough]] and [[AC Milan]] at Celtic Park.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/june/22/celtic-to-host-middlesbrough-fc-at-home-this-summer/ | title=Celtic to host Middlesbrough FC at home this summer | publisher=Celtic FC | date=22 June 2026 | access-date=30 June 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/june/09/celtic-to-host-massive-pre-season-tie-against-ac-milan-/ | title=Celtic to host massive pre-season tie against AC Milan | publisher=Celtic FC | date=9 June 2026 | access-date=30 June 2026}}</ref>

