==Scottish Cup==
{{Main|2026–27 Scottish Cup}}
Celtic will enter the Scottish Cup at the fourth round.

==Scottish League Cup==
{{Main|2026–27 Scottish League Cup}}
On 26 July, Celtic were drawn against [[Dundee United F.C.|Dundee United]] in the second round of the [[2026–27 Scottish League Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/july/26/celtic-face-away-tie-against-dundee-united-in-premier-sports-cup/ | title=Celtic face away tie against Dundee United in Premier Sports Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=26 July 2026 | access-date=28 July 2026}}</ref> On 16 August, Celtic were drawn against [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]] in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/august/16/celtic-face-quarter-final-derby-clash-at-ibrox/ | title=Celtic face quarter-final derby clash at Ibrox | publisher=Celtic FC | date=16 August 2026 | access-date=16 August 2026}}</ref>

