==UEFA Champions League==
{{Main|2026–27 UEFA Champions League}}

===Play-off round===
{{main|2026–27 UEFA Champions League qualifying#Play-off round}}
On 3 August, Celtic were drawn against [[LASK]] in the UEFA Champions League play-off round.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/august/03/Celtic-to-meet-LASK-Linz-in-UEFA-Champions-League-play-offs/ | title=Celtic to meet LASK Linz in UEFA Champions League play-offs | publisher=Celtic FC | date=3 August 2026 | access-date=10 August 2026}}</ref>

