==UEFA Europa League==
{{Main|2026–27 UEFA Europa League}}
Celtic will enter the UEFA Europa League at the [[2026–27 UEFA Europa League league phase|league phase]].

===League phase===
{{main|2026–27 UEFA Europa League league phase}}
On 28 August, the draw for the league phase was made. Celtic were drawn with [[Olympique de Marseille|Marseille]] and [[S.L. Benfica|Benfica]] (Pot 1), [[Ferencvárosi TC|Ferencváros]] and [[Royale Union Saint-Gilloise|Union Saint-Gilloise]] (Pot 2), [[RC Celta de Vigo|Celta Vigo]] and [[AC Omonia|Omonia]] (Pot 3), and [[Beşiktaş J.K.|Beşiktaş]] and [[S.C.U. Torreense|Torreense]] (Pot 4).<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2026/august/28/celtic-s-2026-27-uefa-europa-league-draw/ | title=Celtic's 2026/27 UEFA Europa League draw | publisher=Celtic FC | date=28 August 2026 | access-date=28 August 2026}}</ref>

{{:2026–27 UEFA Europa League league phase|transcludesection=Table|showteam=CLT}}

